<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.recipe.adds`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "add a bag to a wiki's recipe at runtime"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.recipe.adds", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.recipe.adds"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.recipe.adds"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.recipe.adds ~ a layer joins the recipe, hot-reloaded

`lares wiki add-bag <slug> <bag-uri>` asks the daemon to add the bag to the wiki's recipe; the composite adds the layer live and the answer names the stack.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ add

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`add` params=`slug/works bag-uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/bags/notes ~ add a bag to the recipe`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug · bag-uri

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bag-uri` params=`takes/uri needs/required seat/2 as/<bag-uri> ~ the bag's uri`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.recipe.adds slug/works bag-uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/bags/notes]] ~ name the slug and the bag`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's add-bag verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ added

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`added` params=`exit/0 fields/[[slug stack]] ~ the recipe's stack after the add`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki add-bag

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares wiki add-bag]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/edges`>>

